' The rooms' films (`ImageScene`; `preset classic|extended ai none seed 3
' start 0`, New Sandez). The pub's door shows film_06 first; a key closes it
' and the pub opens (`SetScene(…, introScene)`). The trader's door (room 17)
' shows film_05, the trader's sound once, then the trader. v1.2 draws the
' black frame round the view; Escape (Back) and Space (Primary) close it,
' another key does not.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub: film_06
wait 90
snap film06
press left               ' not Primary or Back: the film stays
wait 3
press escape             ' closes it: the pub
wait 10
snap pub_after_film
esc
wait 10
mapclick 224,305         ' the trader: film_05
wait 120
snap film05
press space
wait 10
snap trader_after_film
esc
wait 10
quit
